@host = http://localhost:5265

### Register a synthetic patient
# @name patient
POST {{host}}/api/patients

###
@patientId = {{patient.response.body.$.id}}

### Get the patient
GET {{host}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}

### Register a reading inside the normal range
POST {{host}}/api/vitalreadings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "type": "HeartRate",
  "value": 72,
  "recordedAtUtc": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "deviceId": "monitor-001"
}

### Register a reading that raises a critical alert
# @name critical
POST {{host}}/api/vitalreadings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "type": "HeartRate",
  "value": 180,
  "recordedAtUtc": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "deviceId": "monitor-001"
}

### Rejected: SpO2 above what a device can measure
POST {{host}}/api/vitalreadings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "type": "SpO2",
  "value": 250,
  "recordedAtUtc": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "deviceId": "monitor-001"
}

### List readings, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/readings?limit=20

### List pending alerts
GET {{host}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/alerts?pendingOnly=true

### Acknowledge the critical alert
POST {{host}}/api/alerts/{{critical.response.body.$.alert.id}}/acknowledge

### Health
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Metrics scraped by Prometheus
GET {{host}}/metrics
